    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 20.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa þonne nylle ridan mid his gerefan, gilde cynges oferhyrnesse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone refuses to ride [on such a mission] with his companions, he shall pay the fine for insubordination to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðonne nelle hwa toridan mid his gerefum, gylde cynges oferhyrnesse.</ab>
      </div>
